<svg id="csa-diagram" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 1000 700" width="1000" height="700" role="img" aria-labelledby="csa-title csa-desc"><title id="csa-title">CSA2(2, Full)：压缩、选址与读取</title><desc id="csa-desc">教学例：查询位置9。历史位置1到8形成四条压缩记忆。索引器对四条记忆评分，选C2与C4；主注意力读取这两条全局记忆和窗口内位置7到9的局部KV。</desc><defs><marker id="csa-arrow" markerWidth="7" markerHeight="7" refX="6.4" refY="3.5" orient="auto"><path d="M0 0L7 3.5L0 7Z" fill="#58766b"/></marker></defs><style>#csa-diagram text{font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'PingFang SC',sans-serif}#csa-diagram .csa-edge{fill:none;stroke:#58766b;stroke-width:2;marker-end:url(#csa-arrow)}</style>
